msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl, having finally gathered the courage, began to slowly tell her tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A Garota de Cabelos Brancos, tendo finalmente reunido coragem, começou lentamente a contar "
"sua história."

#: scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
