msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father and I were always on the move, traveling across the land by foot, so it was only "
"recently that we heard rumors of Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Meu pai e eu estávamos sempre em movimento, viajando pela terra a pé, então só recentemente "
"ouvimos rumores da Mansão das Rosas."

#: scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 838aa1b838e63a50754c8e70815a46a8c5f4223258c3bf399c34969bebd61c04
