msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Another reason... ⟪k:1⟫was my father’s line of work.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He painted pictures for a "
"living."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Outra razão...⟪k:1⟫era a profissão do meu pai.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele pintava quadros para viver."

#: scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a79045b9924d3112995b465c16f544a5f6dc35fee6d7c0945b7b27f5a1a31a3b
#. default-sha256: 5e367f881b2376e3f8a8dc16a1b7eb89d471dc1e68a6062a04988d5689048afb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had trouble finding a patron, so he had to work day-to-day...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When he was no "
"longer able to find work in a city, we would move."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas ele teve problemas para encontrar um patrono, então ele tinha que trabalhar dia a dia..."
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quando ele não conseguia mais encontrar trabalho em uma cidade, nós nos mudávamos."

#: scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a188b5a641c11db8ce9855a8a2b87506f160a348560888fcd5affd83202614b7
