msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD6E291F_755C_4BE7_B15C_D83003B2EADE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He held me in his arms and ran his fingers through my hair,⟪k:1⟫an apologetic look on his "
"face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele me segurou em seus braços e passou os dedos pelo meu cabelo,⟪k:1⟫um olhar de desculpas "
"em seu rosto."

#: scenario:scenario_725EE1AB_2004_4A1B_89CD_9CF2B86B71A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d710fd6247a05b5c3ed37d513db0007006d7da81a7df72a75a23d804dd6c982
#. default-sha256: d1a899d67958cde4d5c4a892012b5cdd3f1b50a345daa213098ad0381b5e9ce3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_725EE1AB_2004_4A1B_89CD_9CF2B86B71A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I had a normal appearance...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sure life would have been much easier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se eu tivesse uma aparência normal...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tenho certeza que a vida teria sido muito "
"mais fácil."

#: scenario:scenario_B8E1E342_BE88_4156_A690_13018EBCDAAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 218bce0f64d2b180d8e9b6c0ea465c561c3d213fa8d4254902399d2ac0ed0f9d
#. default-sha256: 1d8dcf4192ab9257efb374062c55ae76c04cdbedde1f2dca22a7f5104dcb0e08
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B8E1E342_BE88_4156_A690_13018EBCDAAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was always telling me how sorry he was for making life so hard,⟪k:1⟫even though it’s not "
"his fault I look like this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele estava sempre me dizendo o quanto estava arrependido por ter tornado a vida tão difícil,"
"⟪k:1⟫mesmo que não fosse culpa dele a minha aparência."

