msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫you wouldn’t even care about the fate of one simple painter.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Our "
"lives meant nothing to you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫vocês nem se importariam com o destino de um simples pintor.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nossas "
"vidas não significavam nada para vocês..."

#: scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a3fbda78f3f11504a0a09e114f09760f5dbf91a73715cac125b25143b010093
