msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In truth, I had wanted to take the master’s life,⟪k:1⟫but your father spends so much time "
"outside the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na verdade, eu queria tirar a vida do mestre,⟪k:1⟫mas seu pai passa muito tempo fora da "
"mansão."

#: scenario:scenario_F4ADF25F_1C0F_4AEB_B771_C5CE544279C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
