"⟪k:0⟫That is the whole of my tale.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You now know about my father—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and how I feel "
"about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Essa é toda a minha história.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Agora você sabe sobre meu pai—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e o que sinto "
"por você."

#: scenario:scenario_316ABADC_699D_4B6E_B376_8C83FA905184
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f4ec549ed3c22cf4c8f0230bd6f9a04a33c17dff62b14cb539f36bb291bab6f
