#: scenario:scenario_1625EB1B_B585_41A7_BB40_9562B88F023E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1895be08d9ee9d37f7c7e65ee2dc8e844647165ff693e90d40c120b2312308c
