msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that was Mother’s doing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então foi obra da mãe."

#: scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ced745241535dc15ad8a80af996485c6e22e850215473b8d1a190c8e869d4fd5
