msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could scarcely believe she would invite a stranger into her home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that she "
"would treat a stranger with such compassion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I thought perhaps she knew who my father "
"was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu mal podia acreditar que ela convidaria uma estranha para sua casa...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫que "
"ela trataria uma estranha com tanta compaixão.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Achei que talvez ela soubesse quem era "
"meu pai."

#: scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a983fbfdafd1c75bbadc8698cea7a560253ded67b10c19652604e9104587dcb7
#. default-sha256: 92d0347d145fb4ce9032ec2fcbb158afa266debf83ef86d2aa5c9653c12d5821
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had never met any of you before,⟪k:1⟫so she must simply be that kindhearted a woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eu nunca tinha conhecido nenhum de vocês antes,⟪k:1⟫então ela deve simplesmente ser uma "
"mulher de bom coração."

#: scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e49075946151c77af917a2c6dad2a0e5e6d464b316b1b12929fdf66074fc135
