msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the mistress continued to treat me with kindness,⟪k:1⟫despite my disquieting appearance "
"and the darkness in my heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E a senhora continuou a me tratar com bondade,⟪k:1⟫apesar da minha aparência inquietante e "
"da escuridão em meu coração."

#: scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c0bb428a5a2d879803e84e64723c5d20c7a641e21f25f1640c213c28a9deaca
#. default-sha256: dea8015fe479fc4c88101ad651d9f825075dfad718d6599a424dde059bc75dd5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In time, I began to grow less and less sure of myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Was what I meant to do truly "
"right?⟪k:3⟫Were the things I felt truly justified?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com o tempo, comecei a ficar cada vez menos segura de mim mesma.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O que eu pretendia "
"fazer era realmente certo?⟪k:3⟫As coisas que eu sentia eram realmente justificadas?"

#: scenario:scenario_8E7DA108_6859_4730_A4FF_05F1A6F1C2DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cff0ca87c46dd89a944f99a05ea918c3ce3e661b30b3d57db7383241e687f7a
