msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do you say we go to the theatre some time?⟪k:1⟫I promise I won’t sleep through it.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫At the private theatre, we can get seats at the far end of the second floor, so we don’t "
