msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mell me procurou no dia seguinte."

#: scenario:scenario_A41251B7_9250_4B65_9D8F_30BAC9398177
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96431b760181d63c767232e4fe86fa67a19738c11500f077653d151367fa865b
