msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was already a very pretty girl, so even without much effort on my part—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫simply "
"putting her in a dress—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she radiated beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela já era uma garota muito bonita, então mesmo sem muito esforço da minha parte—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"simplesmente colocando-a em um vestido—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ela irradiava beleza."

#: scenario:scenario_8DC226C8_9DFB_42BA_BCF3_AEA74EE6CE67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64e0f81fdd0b703f7107ae2eb93a9276f7444af96c745603c7f6ff4241e33101
